{"reviews":[{"id":"B01HT75KHE-0","r":1.0,"t":"... headbands as being cotton but they do not feel like cotton at all","x":"The seller advertises these headbands as being cotton but they do not feel like cotton at all.  They feel like synthetic material.  Very unhappy with them.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-1","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"These seem to be of poor quality and do not fit an adult head.  I would not recommend them.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love the headbands they look exactly like the picture and ...","x":"Love the headbands they look exactly like the picture and it\u2019s super stretchy so it could fit exactly for you head and feel nice and comfortable. If you like headbands like me I would recommend these elastic headband.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-3","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"These are the perfect size. Most of my cotton stretch headbands fall off or are too tight and just slide up my head. These stay in place and the colors are great.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-4","r":5.0,"t":"Exactly what I was looking for","x":"These are PERFECT!!! Exactly what I was looking for. Great fit, don't slip and perfect width. I'm not big on green or purple. I wish they came in doubles of the other colors instead, but I can wear them to work out in or something... I will be purchasing again!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-5","r":5.0,"t":"No complaints so far!","x":"I'm wearing one of these right now as I take down Christmas decorations.  They're really soft and stretchy, but tight enough to stay in place and hold your hair where you want it to be.  I like the muted, earthy colors and think these are well worth the money.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-6","r":2.0,"t":"Disappointing Purchase","x":"Nice colors, but these headbands turned out to be too tight for me, and rode up on my head--unlike what the reviewers said. I passed them on to a friend who likes wide headbands and wears them more toward her forehead, so it doesn't matter as much if they ride up.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-7","r":1.0,"t":"Serious quality decline since last purchase","x":"Note the difference  between the two headbands.  The larger one is from my previous order about a year ago when I would have given these 5's all the way.  The width is about 2.5 inches, the material is appropriately stretchy, and the seam is soft against the skin.  The smaller one is from my latest purchase within the past month.  The width is only 2.25 inches at best (not functional for me), the material is NOT sufficiently stretchy and the seaming is rough against the skin.  I will not buy the","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-8","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"It is so hard to find headbands that fit, are the right width, and stay in place.....but these are perfect! Material is EXACTLY THE SAME as a tee shirt which is so hard to find. They are perfect for my daughter playing a volleyball game and for me while I run. I just need more bright colors!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great basic headband","x":"These are great headbands. Be careful stretching them they won't fit right afterwards. They do slip because there is nothing on them to prevent it. I never wear mine for an activity although they have yoga in the name. The headband would slip too much","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-10","r":3.0,"t":"The colors are nice and the fabric seams durable","x":"The colors are nice and the fabric seams durable, but the headbands are all too tight and small. If you have really thick hair, I'd consider looking for something with a more generous fit.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great Quality.","x":"Excellent quality material, stretchy but not flimsy. VERY comfortable, unlike many other headbands. Worth the price ~ $7 is what I paid in Sep 2021. I will def get these again!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-12","r":2.0,"t":"Two Stars","x":"Bands are a nice color/fit, but after 1 or 2 washings they came apart at the seams.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-13","r":2.0,"t":"Two Stars","x":"TRASH... LOSES ELASTICITY QUICKLY... THEY ALL BECAME STRETCHED OUT.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-14","r":4.0,"t":"Cute","x":"I enjoy wearing these to work and you can wash them with no issues","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-15","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"There stay on for a while, but occasional slip off.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-16","r":1.0,"t":"Do not buy, way too small and tight","x":"I'm disappointed with how tight these headbands are. After having it on for a couple of minutes it crept up the back of my head and pulled the back of my hair half way up my head. I have a very small head so this issue is really surprising. These headbands should be sold as a children's item for sure. Due to the return policy I'm unable to return the headbands, so a perfect waste of money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-17","r":4.0,"t":"They are good","x":"I don't hate them. They are exactly as described and I like that they are wide. My only concern is that they are super tight. They give me a headache the first few times wearing it. I had to try and stretch them out a bit. It has helped so far and I can actually wear them for longer than a half hour. Other than that, I think they are a good, cheap headband.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-18","r":1.0,"t":"If I could give zero stars I would","x":"I\u2019ve bought these in the past and they were great so I\u2019m not sure what exactly has changed about them but they had no stretch whatsoever. Trying to get them over my head was a nightmare. Total waste of money and won\u2019t buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-19","r":5.0,"t":"Not too tight for an average sized female head","x":"These are not as tight as other reviews led me to believe. They fit my head fine and dont loosen throughout the day like the headbands you can buy from walmart or Walgreens. Plus these are better colors.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-20","r":5.0,"t":"Thick fabric, holds shape","x":"It provides a nice tight fit and has held up with multiple washes without losing shape. Thick fabric too. Attached buttons for mask wearing and it has worked out perfectly.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-21","r":5.0,"t":"Best I\u2019ve tried with htv","x":"I love these headbands! I use htv on them and they do well! I\u2019ve tried so many other brands, these are the best. Wish they came in more colors!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-22","r":1.0,"t":"Too small and unstretchy","x":"As many reviewers wrote, these bands are too small for an adult head. They also don\u2019t stretch much so unlikely to get broken in. Returned them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-23","r":1.0,"t":"Super tight","x":"They\u2019re so tight they give me a headache. I wouldn\u2019t recommend these for adults. Probably better for children or pre teens with smaller heads!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B01HT75KHE-24","r":5.0,"t":"Overall a really great headband!!!!","x":"The thickness of the fabric was pretty good and so was the stretch of it. Really great headbands for sports or for normal everyday wear.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the headbands comfortable, soft, stretchy, and well-fitting, staying in place during wear.","cites":[3,4,5,6,9,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers report fit problems, saying the headbands are too tight or small and ride up on the head.","cites":[2,7,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the colors and appearance, matching the pictures.","cites":[3,4,6,7,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers report durability issues, including seams coming apart after washing and loss of elasticity.","cites":[13,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers question the material quality, saying it doesn't feel like cotton or has declined since a previous purchase.","cites":[1,8]}]},"qa":[]}